{"id":"4a3373ca17fc93e6","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-joining.md","title":"Joining","display":"df-joining — Joining","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-joining","aliases":["58-df-joining"],"display":"df-joining — Joining","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-joining"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-joining</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-joining — Joining"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9bd3021c047fb402\" href=\"?note=9bd3021c047fb402\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T)\">\\((X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S)\\)</span> (动力系统参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times Y\">\\(X\\times Y\\)</span> 上的概率测度)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span> (保测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S\\)</span> (全参数推前测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9bd3021c047fb402\" href=\"?note=9bd3021c047fb402\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Joining}\">\\(\\mathrm{Joining}\\)</span> (本文件定义的 joining 谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}joining} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;&amp;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(S,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\n\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(Y)=1\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B,\\pi_X,\\pi_Y,U\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\lambda(X\\times Y)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_X,X\\times Y,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\pi_X(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_Y,X\\times Y,Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\pi_Y(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,X\\times Y,X\\times Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(U(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,X,\\mathcal B_X,\\pi_X,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\pi_Y,\\nu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,U,\\lambda)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}joining} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;&amp;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(S,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\n\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(Y)=1\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B,\\pi_X,\\pi_Y,U\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\lambda(X\\times Y)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_X,X\\times Y,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\pi_X(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_Y,X\\times Y,Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\pi_Y(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,X\\times Y,X\\times Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;(U(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,X,\\mathcal B_X,\\pi_X,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\pi_Y,\\nu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal B,U,\\lambda)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}joining\\text{-}order\\text{-}implicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;T,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu\\;\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}joining\\text{-}order\\text{-}implicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;T,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu\\;\n\\mathrm{Joining}(\\lambda;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Joinings are invariant probability measures on the product with the prescribed marginals. 积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数、两个坐标投影、积作用及三个推前等式均在 assertion 内显式类型化。</li>\n<li>Disjointness means that the product measure is the only joining, not that no joining exists.</li>\n<li>The shorter historical signature existentially hides the two probability spaces; new atoms should use the fully typed signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8bb827e3e31f34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9bd3021c047fb402","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"ta